cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ROS 2 Harness Profile: Projection, Isolation, and Transfer for learned controllers"
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the Middleware '26 paper below."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/csi-dgist/ros2-harness-profile"
url: "https://csi-dgist.github.io/ros2-harness-profile/"
abstract: >-
  Implementation, Harness Profiles, audited run records, and analysis scripts for the
  Middleware 2026 paper "Harness Engineering for Physical AI: Robot Middleware Is the
  Harness Layer". A compiled Profile declares a learned controller's output region,
  inference budget, and operating regime, and a gate on the ROS 2 command path enforces
  them through Projection, Isolation, and Transfer.
